  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid insurance certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Provide a copy of the valid insurance certificate covering your bike during transportation. Ensure that it is issued by an authorized insurance provider and covers the entire transportation period.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA-approved consignment bill:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Obtain an IBA-approved (Indian Bike Association) consignment bill detailing the information about the sender, receiver, and the bike being transported. This bill serves as a contract and covers the responsibilities of both parties.</p>
  </div>
</div>
	<p>In addition to the above documents, it is crucial to ensure that your bike is insured for the entire transportation process. Failure to do so may result in financial losses in case of any accidents or damages during transportation. Therefore, acquiring 100% declared-value marine transit insurance is highly recommended.</p>
	<p>Marine transit insurance covers your bike during transportation through land, air, and sea modes. It ensures that you are financially protected in case of any unforeseen incidents during the journey. Make sure to gather the following marine transit insurance details:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>100% declared-value insurance:</strong> This insurance covers the full value of your bike, ensuring that you are financially compensated in case of any damages or losses during transportation.</li>
		<li><strong>Marine transit insurance:</strong> This type of insurance provides comprehensive coverage for your bike during transportation through various modes of transport.</li>
		<li><strong>Proper documentation:</strong> Ensure that all the necessary documentation is in order, including the insurance policy document, bike registration details, and any other relevant documentation.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>In addition to the above-mentioned documents, it is advisable to conduct a pre-shipment inspection of your bike before sending it for transportation.</p>
	<p>During the pre-shipment inspection, a professional inspector will evaluate and provide a detailed report of the bike's condition. This document will serve as proof of the bike's current condition before transportation and can be used to claim any damages or losses during transportation.</p>
	<p>Following the minimum paperwork and precautions mentioned above will ensure a smooth and hassle-free bike transportation in Siddipet.</div></div>
	<p>While transporting your bike, it is recommended to keep track of the transportation company's contact information and the details of the person responsible for handling your bike.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


